# Link-checker exclusions for lychee (.github/workflows/audit-web.yml, weekly B5
# job). These are trusted image CDN hosts already allow-listed in the CSP
# img-src directive (functions/_middleware.ts) -- excluded here because they
# routinely rate-limit or bot-block automated HEAD/GET probes from CI IP
# ranges (403/503/999-style anti-scraping responses), which is CDN noise, not
# a real dead link. Seeded 2026-07-16; expand only with evidence of the same
# false-positive class (D4 fix-or-retire review), not preemptively.
m\.media-amazon\.com
images-na\.ssl-images-amazon\.com
basemaps\.cartocdn\.com
